{"id": "ja-final-04", "language": "ja", "text": "過去の会話を見せてください。", "frames": 105600, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.09684950113296509, "seconds": 11.95683473799727, "first_audio_seconds": 11.956669253995642, "first_sound_seconds": 12.31033592066231, "duration": 4.4, "rtf": 2.7174624404539247, "chunks": [{"ready": 11.956669253995642, "duration": 4.4}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "f33a7fc6b0434e2e00311487af7781ade589f8eaac31e4f8148cf2187425584b"}
{"id": "ja-final-05", "language": "ja", "text": "今開いたファイルを閉じてください。", "frames": 84480, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.10360149294137955, "seconds": 9.095608317002188, "first_audio_seconds": 9.095465349004371, "first_sound_seconds": 9.513423682337704, "duration": 3.52, "rtf": 2.5839796355119855, "chunks": [{"ready": 9.095465349004371, "duration": 3.52}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "74028c6dbfc3d64ab972f0fe1793e5dd77f37e111b32d338887d3c1c01aa9b03"}
{"id": "ja-final-06", "language": "ja", "text": "保存しないで閉じてください。", "frames": 105600, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.2754659950733185, "seconds": 12.056452943012118, "first_audio_seconds": 12.056283501005964, "first_sound_seconds": 12.255616834339298, "duration": 4.4, "rtf": 2.740102941593663, "chunks": [{"ready": 12.056283501005964, "duration": 4.4}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "4e415165d66e06bde5dec10325a287dbbc7d769141762ed7bd062acded997c39"}
{"id": "ja-final-07", "language": "ja", "text": "閉じないで、そのままにしてください。", "frames": 107520, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.16443374752998352, "seconds": 11.751438581995899, "first_audio_seconds": 11.751268303982215, "first_sound_seconds": 12.413976637315548, "duration": 4.48, "rtf": 2.623088969195513, "chunks": [{"ready": 11.751268303982215, "duration": 4.48}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "fe3de5f6550edd4f82b3d5912f0870e43277b22699b8a0aaed48159d3f7e861e"}
{"id": "ja-final-08", "language": "ja", "text": "バイバイ。またね。", "frames": 115200, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.2372482568025589, "seconds": 12.872729396010982, "first_audio_seconds": 12.872555625013774, "first_sound_seconds": 13.914722291680441, "duration": 4.8, "rtf": 2.6818186241689546, "chunks": [{"ready": 12.872555625013774, "duration": 4.8}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "63bd891b5f9619a4acca5fca6634e2ae633e3b2bd406b9a4f09ac1db4efd2e57"}
{"id": "ja-final-09", "language": "ja", "text": "バイバイを英語に訳してください。会話は続けます。", "frames": 105600, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.20793801546096802, "seconds": 11.859231648995774, "first_audio_seconds": 11.859056199988117, "first_sound_seconds": 12.253931199988118, "duration": 4.4, "rtf": 2.6952799202263122, "chunks": [{"ready": 11.859056199988117, "duration": 4.4}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "6fe4ab33e176ce2419e8eb94d7f8fa8c66ca6fb5f6df62130351a7298cf2d4fb"}
{"id": "ja-final-10", "language": "ja", "text": "一足す一の答えを教えてください。", "frames": 124800, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.18117980659008026, "seconds": 14.283594262989936, "first_audio_seconds": 14.2834112829878, "first_sound_seconds": 15.381827949654467, "duration": 5.2, "rtf": 2.7468450505749877, "chunks": [{"ready": 14.2834112829878, "duration": 5.2}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "dffc2668575e65907250f131fc2278d7eb269b3671570dc158e4cc3f48fb3a95"}
{"id": "ja-final-11", "language": "ja", "text": "こんにちは。今日の天気は雨です。", "frames": 120960, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.2261408418416977, "seconds": 13.763493960985215, "first_audio_seconds": 13.763298414996825, "first_sound_seconds": 14.837965081663492, "duration": 5.04, "rtf": 2.7308519763859556, "chunks": [{"ready": 13.763298414996825, "duration": 5.04}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "0013fbd9f64e7815a6a4602fd325899c9d2b74bbdcba5ccaa072c437347e4a1a"}
{"id": "ja-final-12", "language": "ja", "text": "明日の天気は曇りの予報です。", "frames": 67200, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.16979993879795074, "seconds": 7.38190502699581, "first_audio_seconds": 7.38177362800343, "first_sound_seconds": 7.693815294670096, "duration": 2.8, "rtf": 2.636394652498504, "chunks": [{"ready": 7.38177362800343, "duration": 2.8}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "3b049a7e2e3b3339d3a7cffd37c50f6fb5db6b5d6e1b487d7a4752f4be043abc"}
{"id": "ja-final-13", "language": "ja", "text": "こんにちはと今日の間に全角スペースを入れてください。", "frames": 130560, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.34416714310646057, "seconds": 14.98738802599837, "first_audio_seconds": 14.987192091997713, "first_sound_seconds": 15.623900425331046, "duration": 5.44, "rtf": 2.7550345636026417, "chunks": [{"ready": 14.987192091997713, "duration": 5.44}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "315b34013cbae22aea13db6418b88b9981574e5d405a0bc2c87c53898f133442"}
{"id": "ja-final-14", "language": "ja", "text": "文の最後に句点を付けてください。", "frames": 76800, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.22270570695400238, "seconds": 8.831468157994095, "first_audio_seconds": 8.831343191995984, "first_sound_seconds": 9.259843191995984, "duration": 3.2, "rtf": 2.7598337993731548, "chunks": [{"ready": 8.831343191995984, "duration": 3.2}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "0bfe12d270129447a30646ef032bbb52ad49d76f8015b3bba8e4a5295ead021e"}
{"id": "ja-final-15", "language": "ja", "text": "その文字を消さずに改行してください。", "frames": 145920, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.1341707855463028, "seconds": 16.832585126016056, "first_audio_seconds": 16.832374168006936, "first_sound_seconds": 17.538290834673603, "duration": 6.08, "rtf": 2.768517290463167, "chunks": [{"ready": 16.832374168006936, "duration": 6.08}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "bb81984bc655c77c6f1d40836a8cad95829223beaecf96f1e4534e2ff5958907"}
{"id": "ja-final-16", "language": "ja", "text": "九月二十六日の午後三時半です。", "frames": 88320, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.3846428692340851, "seconds": 9.906779730983544, "first_audio_seconds": 9.906630676006898, "first_sound_seconds": 10.232464009340232, "duration": 3.68, "rtf": 2.6920597095063976, "chunks": [{"ready": 9.906630676006898, "duration": 3.68}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "6c86be4567e277736f189c7b623e736be664c7ea18485dc281b9bf157c410d78"}
{"id": "ja-final-17", "language": "ja", "text": "合計は千二百三十四円です。", "frames": 124800, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.3457840085029602, "seconds": 13.944023824005853, "first_audio_seconds": 13.943834029021673, "first_sound_seconds": 14.212709029021672, "duration": 5.2, "rtf": 2.6815430430780487, "chunks": [{"ready": 13.943834029021673, "duration": 5.2}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "e020cd4e9e838f845cfe573865f6a8acc3244d4dd6dfa73f470cb7e9442d8c2a"}
{"id": "ja-final-18", "language": "ja", "text": "電話番号は零三、一二三四、五六七八です。", "frames": 132480, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.310977965593338, "seconds": 14.870351866993587, "first_audio_seconds": 14.870028809003998, "first_sound_seconds": 15.347028809003998, "duration": 5.52, "rtf": 2.6939043237307225, "chunks": [{"ready": 14.870028809003998, "duration": 5.52}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "69e0298fa8007cfc10587a93db3454b8872529cf006283a111a515c16bbb2002"}
{"id": "ja-final-19", "language": "ja", "text": "温度は二十三点五度です。", "frames": 76800, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.18052995204925537, "seconds": 8.77390996098984, "first_audio_seconds": 8.773781800002325, "first_sound_seconds": 9.254365133335659, "duration": 3.2, "rtf": 2.741846862809325, "chunks": [{"ready": 8.773781800002325, "duration": 3.2}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "72edbeeed60e872a5eb6baea425e60815dea54c7c591d2a928f8fc20a5e33b66"}
{"id": "ja-final-20", "language": "ja", "text": "残り時間は二分三十秒です。", "frames": 69120, "nonfinite_samples": 0, "peak": 0.23577268421649933, "seconds": 7.898491084983107, "first_audio_seconds": 7.898365572997136, "first_sound_seconds": 8.135740572997136, "duration": 2.88, "rtf": 2.7425316267302455, "chunks": [{"ready": 7.898365572997136, "duration": 2.88}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "sample_rate": 24000, "sha256": "08c8e4ab44eab904efe32e03c404abcf3d28a39780051105106ef3775cf2e4eb"}
